abstract: "Prototype: LifeWatch ERIC's metabarcoding pipeline PEMA v3.0.0 (12S) on the public PONDERFUL eDNA reads of 29 ponds west of Ankara, Türkiye, with an NCBI BLAST check and a per-pond summary."
